    <preface>
      <p>Broadcasting Legislation Amendment (Primary Television Broadcasting Service) Act 2015</p>
      <p>No. 127, 2015</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Broadcasting Services Act 1992</i>, and for other purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
